config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_145_DEMO
	bool "Contest 2026 Team 145 Hardware Diagnostic App (demo)"
	default y
	---help---
		Enable the hardware diagnostic and telemetry test demo application
		for OpenVela, providing CLI and GUI testing for battery power,
		microphone status/mute, display brightness, speaker volume, and sensors.
